        "original_id": "2ac687f0-6076-5cf7-94e8-0d4ec2781cf8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Garrett Morris, Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, John Belushi\n- TV Shows: Saturday Night Live, Martin, The Jamie Foxx Show\n- Networks: NBC, Fox\n- Roles: original cast member, Stan Winters, actor, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Garrett Morris was born on February 1, 1937, and he is an American comedian and actor.\n- Garrett Morris was part of the original cast of NBC's sketch comedy show Saturday Night Live from 1975 to 1980.\n- John Belushi was one of the seven original cast members of NBC's Saturday Night Live and was known for his intense energy and raucous attitude on the show.\n- Martin is an American sitcom that aired on Fox for five seasons from August 27, 1992 to May 1, 1997.\n- Garrett Morris played Stan Winters on the sitcom Martin from 1992 to 1995.\n- The Jamie Foxx Show stars Jamie Foxx, Garcelle Beauvais, Christopher B. Duncan, Ellia English, and Garrett Morris.",
